ary and secured Donald Trump's endorsement after rival Jackson Lahmeyer withdrew, against Democrat John Croisant, who is running with modest resources.\n\nTedford has raised roughly ten times more than Croisant and holds a large cash advantage, while reported outside spending has flowed only to him. No public general-election polls exist, but every major rating outlet calls the race Solid or Safe Republican, and prediction markets price a Republican win at about 97 percent. The forecast expects Tedford to win by a comfortable double-digit margin, with the district's partisan lean doing most of the work.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0439, "margin": -11.04}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0097, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0191, "margin": -15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0497, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.0244, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0398, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.05, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.0401, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0392, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0141, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.021, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.0228, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.033, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0238, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.0259, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.0198, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.0096, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.0036, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.0029, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.0175, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.0049, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.0123, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.0108, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.0038, "mar